{#
    Task editing panel without layout (since 1.11), answered by the task_panel route and by the task write routes when
    they are sent with fetch (X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest or a Turbo frame). Hosts load it into a side drawer:
    the same blocks as the task page (edit form, members, priority, subtasks, links); every form posts to the usual
    routes with _target_path = panelTargetPath, so without fetch they come back to the board, list or Gantt page.
    The page around it must load task-board.css / task-board.js (the board, list and Gantt pages do).
#}
{% use '@NowoTaskBoardBundle/manage/_task_blocks.html.twig' %}
<div
    class="nowo-task-panel-fragment"
    data-task-id="{{ task.id }}"
    data-task-url="{{ path(nowo_task_board_route('task'), {taskId: task.id}) }}"
    data-panel-target-path="{{ panelTargetPath|default('') }}"
    aria-label="{{ task.title }}"
    role="region"
>
    {{ block('nowo_task_body') }}
</div>
